<view class="page tab-page"><view class="profile-card"><view class="avatar">饭</view><view class="title">{{account ? account.displayName : '下一餐，好好吃饭。'}}</view><view class="note">{{account ? '学号 ' + account.username : '登录后查看预约与取餐凭证'}}</view><button wx:if="{{!account}}" class="primary" bindtap="login">登录 / 注册</button><text wx:else class="pill">校园学生账号</text></view><view class="card"><view class="menu-link" bindtap="orders"><text>我的预约</text><text>订单、取餐码　›</text></view><view class="menu-link" bindtap="favorites"><text>我的收藏</text><text>再来一餐喜欢的味道　›</text></view><view class="menu-link" bindtap="feedback"><text>意见与反馈</text><text>查看窗口回复　›</text></view></view><view class="note">按需点餐，珍惜每一份食物。当前支付为模拟支付，不扣真实资金。</view><button wx:if="{{account}}" class="outline full" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button><button class="link full" bindtap="settings">服务器设置</button><view wx:if="{{settings}}" class="card"><view class="label">开发联调服务器</view><input value="{{server}}" bindinput="server" placeholder="https://你的域名"/><view class="note">地址只填主机和端口。模拟器可用电脑 localhost；手机需要可达的服务器地址。切换服务器会退出账号。</view><button class="primary full" bindtap="saveServer" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">保存并检查连接</button></view></view>
